{"id":"y9m7erni8tcvfh270z1ir1643","title":"融智学的数学本体论与所有数学难题的系统工程化统一消解","originalTitle":null,"summary":"本文确立数学本体论的一次范式翻转，从内容本体论转为序位本体论，证明所有千年数学难题的病根在于序位错位被误判为内容无解。基于此，本文提出融智学的数学本体论框架，通过道函数零点、理想集合和孪生图灵机等工具，建立可机械执行的标准流水线，以Hodge猜想与罗素悖论为例验证框架的普适性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=94143&do=blog&id=1561104"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T01:37:56.171Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T01:37:56.171Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}